WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:07.632
I haven't been in Dad's room in years.

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:35.035
That pose is so corny, Dad.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:41.166
Why didn't we spend more time together?

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:45.962
Why didn't we talk to each other more?

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:49.340
Why didn't we do more...

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.487
Happy birthday.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:13.823
A present?

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:19.162
It's a sample of my company's new product.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.000
I'm sure you will love it, Aiko.

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:27.712
What is this?

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.257
This looks bad!

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:36.846
I'm going to take a look. You stay here.

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.017
Aiko!

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.564
It seems we're out of time.

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.235
Come with me!

00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:52.195
-What?
-Hurry!

00:01:54.364 --> 00:01:56.032
-What are you--
-The Burst.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.954
The only person who can end this disaster

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:03.456
is you.

00:02:05.041 --> 00:02:07.460
-What is--
-People are here to interfere.

00:02:08.378 --> 00:02:09.629
-Let's go.
-What?

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:12.382
Wait! What?

00:02:13.049 --> 00:02:16.719
Hey, new guy! Where did you go?

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:19.430
-He disappeared?
-Let's go!

00:02:20.056 --> 00:02:21.766
What are you doing?

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.772
Tachibana, we have a package for you.
Are you here?

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.404
-What's going on?
-Buckle up.

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:35.280
What?

00:02:39.742 --> 00:02:41.619
What is going on?

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:48.918
What is this all about?

00:02:51.588 --> 00:02:53.965
-What did you do?
-Turned off your vitals monitor.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:56.092
They can track you if it's on.

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:08.813
The target, Yuya Kanzaki,
has driven off with Aiko Tachibana.

00:03:08.938 --> 00:03:10.023
We're in pursuit.

00:03:19.657 --> 00:03:22.118
Damn! It's the Matter Defense HQ.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:36.549
What? The Town? We can't get in there!

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:41.304
-What's he doing?
-Don't get too close!

00:03:45.808 --> 00:03:48.061
We'll get spotted
if we force our way through.

